{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ab940dcb-47c1-8520-aea5-69d10cd2b596",
  "created_at": "2026-02-22T12:10:19-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Thomas Almy",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:06:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:06:52-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi Kevin. Tom Almy. I know it's Sunday and City Hall's closed, that's why I'm calling this number, somebody said the storm line would be open."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:07:03-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, you got the right place. We're picking up storm calls all weekend. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:07:10-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's the water at my driveway. I'm at 53 Chapel Street, up on the Hill. After that nor'easter, the one that came in Saturday and wrapped up today, the apron at the bottom of my driveway is holding a big puddle. And it doesn't go out to the street, it runs back toward my garage door."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:07:32-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the apron's holding water and it's pitched toward the garage. Got it. Is it getting inside the garage?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:07:40-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's sitting right at the sill. Not in yet. But this happens every time it rains hard, and every time I call somebody says they'll look at it. Nobody looks at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:07:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry about that. Let me put down the address, 53 Chapel. Is there a storm drain close by, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:08:02-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a catch basin down the street, maybe three houses down. Oh, and by the way, the sidewalk in front of it is all leaves and slush, so I don't know if that's part of it. Anyway. The puddle. That's the main thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:08:19-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, so possibly a clogged basin down the block plus the apron grade. I'll note both."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:08:26-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I took pictures, by the way. Six or seven of them, with a tape measure in one so you can see how deep it gets. I can send them if you give me where."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:08:39-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'd help. I don't have an address in front of me for the photos, so I'll have the crew supervisor reach out and tell you where to send them. Best number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:08:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0194. It's my cell, so if it cuts out just try again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:08:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one nine four, got it. Anything else on the property, any other water?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:09:03-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, the basement's fine, thank God. Oh, my neighbor over on the next street, her yard is flooded worse than mine, she said, but that's her business, she can call herself. I'm just worried about my own garage door."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:09:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll note that she's had water too, in case it's the same drainage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:09:24-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. You know, this reminds me of one of those old radio shows, where somebody calls in with a problem and it goes round and round and never gets solved. [pause] Sorry, that's just how it feels."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:09:38-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I'll make sure this gets in front of the right people and doesn't just sit in a log."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:09:47-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd appreciate that. I've been told that before, though. Can somebody call me back when it's done? Not when it's scheduled, when it's actually done."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:09:57-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put that in the notes, call back once the work is completed, and the photos request too. Crews are stretched after a storm like this, so it may take a bit, but it's on the list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:10:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That's all I've got. Thanks, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:10:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, Tom. Stay dry out there."
    }
  ],
